# The hotspot's Share VPN switch, as a unit state: active = the clients' traffic may leave only through the phone's VPN.
# Does nothing itself; omamobile-hotspot.service's helper (hotspot-ap) reads it at start and every poll and keeps the
# nftables kill switch and the routing rule in line with it. Started and stopped by hotspot-backend (polkit rule
# 50-omamobile-hotspot.rules). Never enabled: off after a reboot until the hotspot is turned on with the switch saved.
[Unit]
Description=Wi-Fi hotspot: share the VPN only (kill switch)
ConditionPathExists=/usr/share/omamobile/hotspot.conf

[Service]
Type=oneshot
RemainAfterExit=yes
ExecStart=/bin/true
